# LaunchAgents installed during the hub build rather than machine setup.
install-token-rotator|not installed by setup: rotation updates only the Cloudflare relay and Keychain, not the cicd Secret or GitHub secret (docs/bugs/2026-10-30-machine-setup-installs-hub-agents-before-cutover.md)
install-hub-snapshot|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-hub-data-export|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-vault-failover|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-prometheus-auth-proxy|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-prometheus-credential-rotator|available to hub-new; not installed by generic machine setup because it is a singleton
webhook-token-rotate|installed only after cutover; rotates shared Cloudflare and GitHub secrets
sandbox.argocd-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.frontend-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.grafana-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.keycloak-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.vault-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.hub-pushgateway-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.hub-loki-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.alertmanager-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
argocd-browser-https|system LaunchDaemon managed by cluster-up
frontend-browser-http|system LaunchDaemon managed by cluster-up
keycloak-browser-http|system LaunchDaemon managed by cluster-up
chrome-cdp|ACG browser lifecycle, not a hub service
sandbox.loopback-alias|system LaunchDaemon managed by cluster-up
sandbox.ssh-tunnel|ACG sandbox lifecycle, managed by make up
sandbox.frontend-browser-http|system LaunchDaemon managed by cluster-up
sandbox.prometheus-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
sandbox.pushgateway-port-forward|managed by the ACG sandbox lifecycle (make up)
heartbeat|not loaded by hub-new or cutover: bin/k3dm-heartbeat-setup renders a review candidate only
